#: docking/core/tips.py:57
msgid "Open the dock menu from anywhere"
msgstr "Dock menyusini istalgan joydan oching"

#: docking/core/tips.py:59
msgid ""
"Hold Ctrl and right-click anywhere on the shelf to open the dock menu. This "
"is the quickest path to Preferences, Applets, Diagnostics, and Quit when "
"there is no empty space near the icons."
msgstr ""
"Dock menyusini ochish uchun Ctrl tugmachasini bosib ushlab turing va "
"javonning istalgan joyini o'ng tugmasini bosing. Bu piktogramma yonida bo'sh "
"joy bo'lmasa, Preferences, Applets, Diagnostics va Chiqishning eng tezkor "
"yo'lidir."

#: docking/core/tips.py:67
msgid "Start with Preferences"
msgstr "Preferences bilan boshlang"

#: docking/core/tips.py:69
msgid ""
"Use Preferences to adjust position, monitor behavior, icon size, zoom, "
"hiding, themes, previews, tooltips, and click actions. It is the best first "
"stop when the dock does not feel quite right."
msgstr ""
"Joylashuvni, xatti-harakatini, piktogramma o'lchamini, masshtabni, "
"yashirishni, mavzularni, oldindan ko'rishni, asboblar maslahatlarini va "
"bosish harakatlarini sozlash uchun afzalliklardan foydalaning. Dock o'zini "
"to'g'ri his qilmasa, bu eng yaxshi birinchi to'xtash joyidir."

#: docking/core/tips.py:76
msgid "Add applets from the dock menu"
msgstr "Dock menyusidan appletlar qo'shing"

#: docking/core/tips.py:78
msgid ""
"Right-click the shelf background and choose Add Applet to add launchers, "
"system status, media controls, productivity helpers, and small utility tools "
"directly to the dock."
msgstr ""
"Raf fonida sichqonchaning o'ng tugmachasini bosing va ishga tushirgichlar, "
"tizim holati, media boshqaruvlari, unumdorlik yordamchilari va kichik "
"yordamchi vositalarni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri dockga qo'shish uchun Applet "
"qo'shish-ni tanlang."

#: docking/core/tips.py:85
msgid "Use separators for organization"
msgstr "Tashkilot uchun ajratgichlardan foydalaning"

#: docking/core/tips.py:87
msgid ""
"Right-click where a divider should go and choose Add Separator. Separators "
"make it easier to keep pinned apps, folders, and applets in clear groups."
msgstr ""
"Ajratuvchi bo'lishi kerak bo'lgan joyga sichqonchaning o'ng tugmachasini "
"bosing va Ajratuvchi qo'shish-ni tanlang. Separatorlar mahkamlangan "
"ilovalar, papkalar va appletlarni aniq guruhlarda saqlashni osonlashtiradi."

#: docking/core/tips.py:94
msgid "Pin running apps"
msgstr "Ishlayotgan ilovalarni mahkamlang"

#: docking/core/tips.py:96
msgid ""
"Right-click a running app and choose Keep in Dock. The launcher will stay "
"available after the app closes, so you can start it again with one click."
msgstr ""
"Ishlayotgan ilovani sichqonchaning o‘ng tugmasi bilan bosing va Dockda "
"saqlash-ni tanlang. Ilova yopilgandan keyin ishga tushirish moslamasi mavjud "
"bo'lib qoladi, shuning uchun uni bir marta bosish bilan qayta ishga "
"tushirishingiz mumkin."

#: docking/core/tips.py:103
msgid "Remove pinned items quickly"
msgstr "Qattiqlangan narsalarni tezda olib tashlang"

#: docking/core/tips.py:105
msgid ""
"Right-click a pinned item and choose Remove from Dock, or drag unlocked "
"items off the dock. Removing a launcher does not uninstall the application "
"or delete your files."
msgstr ""
"Qattiqlangan elementni sichqonchaning o‘ng tugmasi bilan bosing va Dockdan "
"olib tashlash-ni tanlang yoki qulfdan chiqarilgan elementlarni dokdan tortib "
"torting. Launcherni olib tashlash ilovani o'chirib tashlamaydi yoki "
"fayllaringizni o'chirib tashlamaydi."

#: docking/core/tips.py:112
msgid "Drop items onto the dock"
msgstr "Elementlarni dockga tashlang"

#: docking/core/tips.py:114
msgid ""
"Drag applications, .desktop files, files, folders, and AppImages onto "
"Docking to pin them. Dropped folders become folder stacks, and dropped "
"AppImages can get their own launcher."
msgstr ""
"Ilovalar, .desktop fayllari, fayllar, papkalar va AppImages-ni mahkamlash "
"uchun Docking-ga torting. Olib tashlangan papkalar papkalar to'plamiga "
"aylanadi va tushirilgan AppImages o'z ishga tushirish moslamasini olishi "
"mumkin."

#: docking/core/tips.py:121
msgid "Open files with dock apps"
msgstr "Dock ilovalari yordamida fayllarni oching"

#: docking/core/tips.py:123
msgid ""
"Drag a file onto an application icon to open it with that app. This is "
"useful when the file manager would otherwise choose the wrong default "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Faylni ilova bilan ochish uchun uni ilova belgisiga torting. Bu fayl "
"menejeri noto'g'ri standart dasturni tanlaganda foydali bo'ladi."

#: docking/core/tips.py:130
msgid "Use folder stacks"
msgstr "Papkalar to'plamidan foydalaning"

#: docking/core/tips.py:132
msgid ""
"Pin a folder and click it from the dock to browse its contents without "
"opening a file manager first. It works well for common places like "
"Downloads, Projects, and screenshots."
msgstr ""
"Jildni mahkamlang va avval fayl boshqaruvchisini ochmasdan uning mazmunini "
"ko'rib chiqish uchun dokdan bosing. U Yuklamalar, Loyihalar va skrinshotlar "
"kabi keng tarqalgan joylar uchun yaxshi ishlaydi."

#: docking/core/tips.py:139
msgid "Tune folder stack behavior"
msgstr "Jildlar stekining harakatini sozlash"

#: docking/core/tips.py:141
msgid ""
"Right-click a pinned folder to sort contents, show hidden files, or "
"customize its icon. These options let each stack behave like the folder it "
"represents."
msgstr ""
"Tarkibni saralash, yashirin fayllarni ko'rsatish yoki uning belgisini "
"sozlash uchun mahkamlangan jildni o'ng tugmasini bosing. Ushbu parametrlar "
"har bir stek o'zi ko'rsatadigan papka kabi harakat qilishiga imkon beradi."

#: docking/core/tips.py:148
msgid "Customize pinned icons"
msgstr "Qattiqlangan piktogrammalarni moslashtiring"

#: docking/core/tips.py:150
msgid ""
"Right-click a pinned app, file, or folder and use Icon -> Choose From File. "
"Custom icons are stored in Docking's config, so the original desktop file or "
"file on disk is left untouched."
msgstr ""
"Belgilangan ilova, fayl yoki jildni sichqonchaning o‘ng tugmasi bilan bosing "
"va Belgi -> Fayldan tanlang. Maxsus piktogrammalar Docking "
"konfiguratsiyasida saqlanadi, shuning uchun asl ish stoli fayli yoki "
"diskdagi faylga tegmasdan qoladi."

#: docking/core/tips.py:157
msgid "Use the Applications applet search"
msgstr "Ilovalar applet qidiruvidan foydalaning"

#: docking/core/tips.py:159
msgid ""
"Add the Applications applet, open it, and type to filter installed apps. It "
"gives you a compact launcher menu without leaving the dock."
msgstr ""
"Ilovalar ilovasini qo'shing, uni oching va o'rnatilgan ilovalarni filtrlash "
"uchun yozing. U sizga dokdan chiqmasdan ixcham ishga tushirish menyusini "
"beradi."

#: docking/core/tips.py:166
msgid "Use Run Application like Alt+F2"
msgstr "Alt+F2 kabi Run ilovasidan foydalaning"

#: docking/core/tips.py:168
msgid ""
"Add Run Application to launch commands, apps, and terminal commands from the "
"dock. As you type, matching applications are shown so you can launch by name "
"or run a standalone command."
msgstr ""
"Dockdan buyruqlar, ilovalar va terminal buyruqlarini ishga tushirish uchun "
"Run Application ilovasini qo'shing. Siz kiritganingizda, mos keladigan "
"ilovalar ko'rsatiladi, shuning uchun siz nom bo'yicha ishga tushirishingiz "
"yoki mustaqil buyruqni ishga tushirishingiz mumkin."

#: docking/core/tips.py:175
msgid "Use window previews"
msgstr "Oynani oldindan ko'rishdan foydalaning"

#: docking/core/tips.py:177
msgid ""
"Hover running apps to inspect open windows before switching. Previews help "
"when one application has several windows open."
msgstr ""
"Oʻtishdan oldin ochiq oynalarni tekshirish uchun ishlayotgan ilovalar ustiga "
"kursorni olib keling. Bir dasturda bir nechta oyna ochiq bo'lsa, oldindan "
"ko'rish yordam beradi."

#: docking/core/tips.py:183
msgid "Choose your click behavior"
msgstr "Bosish harakatingizni tanlang"

#: docking/core/tips.py:185
msgid ""
"Preferences -> Behavior lets left click toggle, cycle, or focus the most "
"recent window. Pick the behavior that matches how you switch between running "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"Preferences -> Behavior chap tugmasini bosish orqali eng so'nggi oynani "
"almashtirish, aylantirish yoki fokuslash imkonini beradi. Ishlayotgan "
"ilovalar o'rtasida qanday o'tishingizga mos keladigan xatti-harakatni "
"tanlang."

#: docking/core/tips.py:192
msgid "Ctrl-click opens a new window"
msgstr "Ctrl-ni bosish yangi oynani ochadi"

#: docking/core/tips.py:194
msgid ""
"Hold Ctrl while clicking an app icon to launch another window. This works "
"even when the app is already running and a normal click would focus it."
msgstr ""
"Boshqa oynani ishga tushirish uchun ilova belgisini bosish paytida Ctrl "
"tugmasini bosib turing. Bu ilova allaqachon ishlayotgan bo'lsa ham ishlaydi "
"va oddiy bosish unga diqqatni qaratadi."

#: docking/core/tips.py:201
msgid "Use app right-click menus"
msgstr "Ilovani o'ng tugmasini bosish menyularidan foydalaning"

#: docking/core/tips.py:203
msgid ""
"Right-click apps for desktop actions, open windows, recent documents, "
"pinning, and close actions. Many apps expose useful shortcuts there, such as "
"opening a private window or composing a new message."
msgstr ""
"Ish stolidagi harakatlar, oynalarni ochish, so'nggi hujjatlar, mahkamlash va "
"yopish amallari uchun ilovalarni o'ng tugmasini bosing. Ko'pgina ilovalar u "
"erda shaxsiy oynani ochish yoki yangi xabar yozish kabi foydali yorliqlarni "
"ko'rsatadi."

#: docking/core/tips.py:211
msgid "Use Recent Files"
msgstr "Oxirgi fayllardan foydalaning"

#: docking/core/tips.py:213
msgid ""
"Add the Recent Files applet to jump back into documents you used recently. "
"It is a faster path when you remember the file, not the folder."
msgstr ""
"Yaqinda foydalangan hujjatlarga qaytish uchun Recent Files ilovasini "
"qo'shing. Bu papkani emas, balki faylni eslaganingizda tezroq yo'ldir."

#: docking/core/tips.py:220
msgid "Use System Tray when needed"
msgstr "Zarur bo'lganda tizim tepsisidan foydalaning"

#: docking/core/tips.py:222
msgid ""
"Add System Tray for tray/status apps and use its menu to manage tray "
"ownership when supported. This helps with legacy apps that still rely on a "
"classic notification area."
msgstr ""
"Tovoqlar/holat ilovalari uchun tizim tepsisini qo'shing va qo'llab-"
"quvvatlansa, laganda egaligini boshqarish uchun uning menyusidan "
"foydalaning. Bu hali ham klassik bildirishnoma maydoniga tayanadigan eski "
"ilovalarga yordam beradi."

#: docking/core/tips.py:229
msgid "Use Diagnostics for support"
msgstr "Yordam uchun diagnostikadan foydalaning"

#: docking/core/tips.py:231
msgid ""
"Open Diagnostics before filing an issue to copy backend, session, and "
"feature details. Including that report makes it much easier to understand "
"compositor, monitor, and environment-specific problems."
msgstr ""
"Backend, seans va funksiya tafsilotlarini nusxalash uchun muammoni "
"topshirishdan oldin Diagnostics-ni oching. Ushbu hisobotni kiritish "
"kompozitor, monitor va atrof-muhitga xos muammolarni tushunishni ancha "
"osonlashtiradi."

